# Purpose: keep the Pattern layout identical across two entries from the Clip launcher.
# Expect: semantic:pattern_first:mode=sequencer.pattern, semantic:pattern_second:mode=sequencer.pattern
# Expect: capture_same:pattern_first=pattern_second
0 scenario clip-launcher-v3
200 encoder NAV 0.01
500 capture screen clip_focus
800 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
1200 capture screen pattern_first
1500 tap LEFT_TOP 60
1900 capture screen returned
2200 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
2600 capture screen pattern_second
2900 tap LEFT_TOP 60
3300 capture screen returned_again
